  "title": "STM32CubeCLT 1.22.0 released",
  "content": "<p><strong>We are pleased to announce that STM32CubeCLT 1.22.0 release is now available </strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#3498db;\"><strong>What is new in 1.22.0: </strong></span></p><ul><li>\t<p>Updated to align with STM32CubeIDE v2.2.0   </p>\t</li></ul><ul><li>\t<p>Updated STM32CubeProgrammer to version 2.23.0  </p>\t</li></ul><ul><li>\t<p>Updated ST-LINK GDB server to version 7.14.0  </p>\t</li></ul><ul><li>\t<p>Updated JRE™ to version 21.0.10+7   </p>\t</li></ul><ul><li>\t<p>Updated STARM-Clang to version 21.1.1+st.7  </p>\t</li></ul><ul><li>\t<p>Updated Ninja to version 1.13.2  </p>\t</li></ul><ul><li>\t<p>Updated CMake to version 4.3.1   </p>\t</li></ul><ul><li>\t<p>Added support for make 4.4.1_st_20260330-0700  </p>\t</li></ul><p><span style=\"color:#3498db;\"><strong>Main fixed issues in 1.22.0:</strong></span></p><ul><li>Refer to the following Link <a href=\"https://wiki.st.com/stm32mcu/wiki/STM32CubeIDE:STM32CubeIDE_errata_2.2.x#STM32CubeCLT_issues\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u>here</u></a> </li></ul><p><span style=\"color:#3498db;\"><strong>Know problems and limitations in 1.22.0: </strong></span></p><ul><li>Refer to the following Link <a href=\"https://wiki.st.com/stm32mcu/wiki/STM32CubeIDE:STM32CubeIDE_errata_2.2.x#STM32CubeCLT_issues\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u>here</u></a> </li></ul><p><span style=\"color:#3498db;\"><strong>How to get STM32CubeCLT 1.22.0: </strong></span></p><ul><li>\t<p>Download STM32CubeCLT 1.22.0  from  <a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/development-tools/stm32cubeclt.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u>here</u></a> </p>\t</li></ul>",
